  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Centre for Integrated Mountain Dev. (ICIMOD), 2011-2016 - ICIMOD 2011-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Centre for Integrated Mountain Dev. (ICIMOD), 2011-2016</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida st&#xf6;djer organisationen International Centre for Intergrated      Mountain Development&#xb4;s tv&#xe5; regionala program: 1) Reducing the impacts of Black Carbon and other short- lived climate forcers. 2) The        Himalayan Climate Change Adaptation programme. Sverige bidrar med 50  MSEK. Fokuset &#xe4;r att minska utsl&#xe4;pp av korta klimatgaser samt att     uppn&#xe5; b&#xe4;ttre kunskap om effekter av klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar/ anpassning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida supports two of ICIMODs regional programmes. 1) The Black Carbon Programmes aims att enhancing scientific understanding of black       carbon and other short- lived climate forcers. 2) The Himalayan       Climate Change Adaptation programme aims at reducing the uncertanties of impact of climate change the development , enhance capcity etc.    The support is estimated to 50 MSEK.</narrative>
  </description>
